Step 1 — On your Windows laptop
Open PowerShell in your local project folder:
cd C:\Users\washo\Desktop\eltut-tours-platform


Check which files have changed:
git status


Add and commit your changes:
git add static/css/eltut.css templates/base.html templates/index.html
git commit -m "Update website styling and homepage templates"
git push origin main


If you changed additional CSS files, include those too. You can use git add with their paths.
Step 2 — Update the VPS
Connect to your VPS using SSH, then run:
cd /var/www/eltut-tours-platform


Check the current server changes first:
runuser -u luxorapp -- git -C /var/www/eltut-tours-platform status


Then pull the updates:
runuser -u luxorapp -- git -C /var/www/eltut-tours-platform pull --ff-only


If the pull succeeds
Restart Flask:
systemctl restart luxordahabiya.service


Check that it is running:
systemctl status luxordahabiya.service --no-pager


You want to see:
Active: active (running)


Step 3 — Check your live website
Open:

https://www.luxordahabiya.com

Press Ctrl + F5 to force-refresh the CSS and templates.